        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 258.06,
          "end": 260.46,
          "en": "you have the widget that should be created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.46,
          "end": 263.433,
          "en": "for every item in that list of data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.27,
          "end": 266.76,
          "en": "So here I'm creating one ChartBar widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 266.76,
          "end": 268.953,
          "en": "for every bucket in my list of buckets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.79,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "And buckets, keep in mind, is this getter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 277.413,
          "en": "where I return this list of four ExpenseBucket instances.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.49,
          "end": 280.89,
          "en": "So I'm looping through these buckets here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.89,
          "end": 283.5,
          "en": "and I'm creating one ChartBar in this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 286.023,
          "en": "that belongs to this row for every bucket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.22,
          "end": 290.90999999999997,
          "en": "Now, the ChartBar has one fill parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.90999999999997,
          "end": 293.28,
          "en": "which is set to a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.28,
          "end": 298.08,
          "en": "And the number is based on the total expenses in a bucket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.08,
          "end": 301.56,
          "en": "So that is this totalExpenses getter being used here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 301.56,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "So the sum of all the expenses that belong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 307.593,
          "en": "to a certain category, divided by maxTotalExpenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 309.03,
          "end": 311.85,
          "en": "And maxTotalExpenses is actually a getter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.85,
          "end": 313.773,
          "en": "that belongs to this chart widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 314.61,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "In this getter, I go through all my buckets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "with another for in loop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 319.41,
          "end": 323.34,
          "en": "and then I simply determine the highest total expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.34,
          "end": 326.52,
          "en": "from all these buckets, so from all these four buckets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 326.52,
          "end": 327.54,
          "en": "in this case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 327.54,
          "end": 329.31,
          "en": "I do that here by taking a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 329.31,
          "end": 331.62,
          "en": "at each bucket's total expenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 331.62,
          "end": 334.23,
          "en": "so the sum of all the expenses in that bucket,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 334.23,
          "end": 337.26,
          "en": "and if that's higher than the highest total expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 337.26,
          "end": 340.26,
          "en": "I got up to this point starting at 0,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 340.26,
          "end": 342.27,
          "en": "I take that bucket's total expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 342.27,
          "end": 344.94,
          "en": "as the highest amount of total expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 344.94,
          "end": 347.7,
          "en": "And I'm doing this because in the end, in the chart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 347.7,
          "end": 350.61,
          "en": "the goal, of course, is to put these different bars",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 350.61,
          "end": 352.29,
          "en": "in relation to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 352.29,
          "end": 354.57,
          "en": "And the bucket with the highest expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 354.57,
          "end": 356.7,
          "en": "should have the tallest ChartBar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 356.7,
          "end": 359.34000000000003,
          "en": "and the other buckets' ChartBars should be drawn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 359.34000000000003,
          "end": 361.11,
          "en": "in relation to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 361.11,
          "end": 363.84,
          "en": "So that's what I'm doing here with this getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 363.84,
          "end": 367.47,
          "en": "And I'm simply passing the division of the total expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 367.47,
          "end": 371.22,
          "en": "of a single bucket by the maximum total expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 371.22,
          "end": 373.55,
          "en": "across all buckets to ChartBar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 373.55,
          "end": 377.46,
          "en": "because in chart_bar, we're using this fill parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 377.46,
          "end": 379.71,
          "en": "and this fill property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 379.71,
          "end": 383.19,
          "en": "to set our ChartBar height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 383.19,
          "end": 385.17,
